{"The promise returned by addMembers resolves before the member list is actually reloaded via findMembers(), so callers awaiting this method may act on a stale members collection": 0.21620409190654755, "The totalPages computation is off by one when the user count is an exact multiple of the page size (limit), causing an extra empty page to appear and breaking the showingLast logic; should use ceiling division instead of Math.floor(...)+1": 0.8555049896240234, "Test for removing members from automatic groups uses hardcoded group id 1, calls action with PUT instead of DELETE (which success case uses), and doesn't create required records": 0.8199484944343567, "Admin group membership routes generate /admin/groups/:id/members.json but controller actions require group_id parameter; route only provides id so calls will fail with ParameterMissing": 0.11314958333969116, "The loop in group/members.hbs iterates over 'members' but the route provides data via 'model', so the table will render no rows despite having data": 0.34971681237220764, "The fixed 350px width on inputs/textareas/selects in groups and badges forms causes layout breakage and horizontal overflow on narrow viewports": 0.4139673411846161, "When creating a group, setting visible unconditionally to false when the visible parameter is absent overrides the model/database default of true, causing newly created groups to be hidden": 0.9070061445236206, "Removing a member via group.users.delete(user_id) bypasses GroupUser model callbacks, so the user_count counter cache is not decremented and becomes inconsistent": 0.5254786610603333, "Pagination parameters (limit/offset) are taken directly from request without validation; negative or zero values can cause invalid SQL LIMIT/OFFSET values or database errors": 0.8423231840133667}